# Copy to .statusline.local and fill in your values.
# This file is gitignored; the example is tracked.

# Claude web-session usage is configured entirely in 1Password. Create a Login
# item named `claude.ai_statusline`: put the organization ID in username and the
# complete browser Cookie value (the value after `-b` in a working curl request)
# in password. The hook reads both at request time, so they never persist under
# ~/.claude. The response is cached; it is never fetched while rendering.
